      "title": "Latent-mask editing server prerequisite",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Requires a vLLM-Omni server that declares latent-mask editing support (MiniMax-H3, EDIT-01).\n\nMiniMax-H3 Temporal Mask builds one mask slice per output frame: the source prefix is preserved (0) and the rest is regenerated (1). Continuation keeps preserve_fraction of the source; extension keeps the whole source and needs a duration longer than it. Keep Temporal Mask duration equal to Generate Video duration."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
